{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning Before Purchase:</strong> This game uses microphone input and requires you to <i>scream</i> &quot;Ice Cream&quot; into your mic. If you do not have a microphone or suffer from a fear of ice cream, please refrain from purchasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I scream Ice cream</strong> is a single-player precision action game using a physics engine that lets you <i>scream</i> &quot;Ice Cream&quot; more than any other game. By actually using your voice, you'll control the Ice Cream Soul to clear 30 perilous and challenging levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control the Ice Cream Soul with your voice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700280/extras/13bbb0ff19dd654abffb580f89f088ee.poster.avif?t=1753784372\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700280/extras/13bbb0ff19dd654abffb580f89f088ee.webm?t=1753784372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700280/extras/13bbb0ff19dd654abffb580f89f088ee.mp4?t=1753784372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you <i>scream</i> &quot;Ice Cream&quot; with all your might, the Ice Cream Soul, wandering the Hyper Ice Cream Dimension, will jet forward while spewing rainbow dreams. Pour your heart into your scream and guide the Ice Cream Soul to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scream is the impulse of life.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls of lava, giant gummy bear monsters, pigeons with madness in their eyes... Contact with any of these threats will cause your soul to evaporate in an instant. Enjoy a hard yet creamy experience through precise stick controls and microphone input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is the Ice Cream Soul?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700280/extras/a8cf16f059435441e32c3b0d1fedfcef.avif?t=1753784372\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700280/extras_big/a8cf16f059435441e32c3b0d1fedfcef.avif?t=1753784372 width=800 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These weird little guys are Ice Cream Souls.<br>They float through the Hyper Ice Cream Dimension, waiting for your guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And when all the souls scream together,the Ice Cream Big Bang will occur...</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700280?t=1753784372","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700280?t=1753784372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700280/5c682b04708c3dfef24860f738b314d76434f69b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753784372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700280/5c682b04708c3dfef24860f738b314d76434f69b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753784372","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning Before Purchase:</strong> This game uses microphone input and requires you to <i>scream</i> &quot;Ice Cream&quot; into your mic. If you do n